OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree talks resume at
OL,4,AHillsborough as residents' legal
OL,5,Achallenge postponed
OL,6,
OL,7,FMembers of Portadown Orange Order and
OL,8,Fthe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition
OL,9,Fhave arrived separately at Hillsborough
OL,10,FCastle for further talks on the
OL,11,FDrumcree parading dispute.
OL,13,FThe Orange Order delegation included
OL,14,FPortadown district master Nigel Dawson
OL,15,Fand loyalist activist Jamie Bryson, who
OL,16,Fhas been acting as their legal adviser.
OL,18,FGRRC chairman Breandan Mac Cionnaith
OL,19,Fsaid he did not know what to expect
OL,20,Ffrom the latest round of discussions.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
