OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree talks resume at
OL,4,AHillsborough as residents' legal
OL,5,Achallenge postponed
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, lawyers for the GRRC issued
OL,8,Fa fresh legal bid to try to prevent the
OL,9,Fmarch from going ahead. It was due to
OL,10,Fbe heard on Friday but has been
OL,11,Fpostponed until Monday to allow for
OL,12,Fmore talks involving the secretary of
OL,13,Fstate.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
